## Dark Mode

The project uses `next-themes` for dark mode. Classes automatically apply:

```typescript
// Theme provider in App.tsx
<ThemeProvider defaultTheme="system">

// Toggle theme
import { useTheme } from "@/components/ThemeProvider";
const { theme, toggleTheme } = useTheme();

// CSS variables automatically switch between light/dark values
// No need for dark: prefix in most cases
```

## Avoid These Patterns

```typescript
// DON'T use inline styles
<div style={{ padding: 16 }}>  // Bad

// DO use Tailwind classes
<div className="p-4">  // Good

// DON'T use CSS modules or styled-components
// DO use Tailwind with cn() utility

// DON'T hardcode colors
<div className="bg-[#ff0000]">  // Bad

// DO use theme colors
<div className="bg-destructive">  // Good
```
